---
// Team2: three larger horizontal cards with avatar, name, role, short bio and a link.
---

<section class="bg-surface py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-24 lg:self-start">
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-4xl">Meet the founders</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">Three people who spent a decade inside noisy project tools and decided to build the one they wished they had.</p>
        <a href="/about" class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-button border border-line bg-bg px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-fg transition hover:border-brand-400">
          <span>Our story</span>
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 12h14" />
            <path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:col-span-2">
        <article class="flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-card border border-line bg-bg p-6 shadow-sm sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:p-8">
          <img src="/media/avatar-1.svg" alt="Portrait of Elena Vasquez" width="112" height="112" loading="lazy" class="h-28 w-28 shrink-0 rounded-card border border-line object-cover" />
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Elena Vasquez</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">Co-founder and CEO</p>
            <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">Elena led operations at two fast-growing studios before starting Halcyon. She still answers a share of support email every week to stay close to how teams really plan.</p>
            <a href="/about" class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-fg transition hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-400">
              <span>Read Elena's notes on calm work</span>
              <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M7 17L17 7" />
                <path d="M8 7h9v9" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-card border border-line bg-bg p-6 shadow-sm sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:p-8">
          <img src="/media/avatar-2.svg" alt="Portrait of Jonas Lindqvist" width="112" height="112" loading="lazy" class="h-28 w-28 shrink-0 rounded-card border border-line object-cover" />
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Jonas Lindqvist</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">Co-founder and CTO</p>
            <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">Jonas spent eight years building real-time collaboration systems and has strong opinions about loading spinners. He makes sure Halcyon opens in under a second, on any connection.</p>
            <a href="/about" class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-fg transition hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-400">
              <span>See how we build for speed</span>
              <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M7 17L17 7" />
                <path d="M8 7h9v9" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-card border border-line bg-bg p-6 shadow-sm sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:p-8">
          <img src="/media/avatar-3.svg" alt="Portrait of Naomi Okafor" width="112" height="112" loading="lazy" class="h-28 w-28 shrink-0 rounded-card border border-line object-cover" />
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg">Naomi Okafor</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">Co-founder and Head of Design</p>
            <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">Naomi designs by taking things away until only the useful part is left. Before Halcyon she led design for a calendar app used by two million people.</p>
            <a href="/about" class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-fg transition hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-400">
              <span>Explore our design principles</span>
              <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M7 17L17 7" />
                <path d="M8 7h9v9" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
